WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.900
Accountability failures within the Armed Forces are mapped through the military justice system.

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:16.025
Five severe cases of misconduct within the National Investigation Service are documented, including evidence tampering condemned by the Ontario Superior Court.

00:00:16.025 --> 00:00:20.437
The internal oversight mechanisms are entirely compromised.
